msgid "Connect a Device"
msgstr "Pripojte zariadenie"

#: src/window.ui:57
msgid ""
"Plug in an Apple device with a USB cable. Devices in recovery or DFU mode "
"work too. A Mac with Apple silicon has to be in DFU mode."
msgstr ""
"Pripojte zariadenie Apple pomocou kábla USB. Fungujú aj zariadenia v režime "
"obnovy alebo DFU. Mac s čipom Apple musí byť v režime DFU."

